    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d758">

                <pb facs="1036" n="1026" xml:id="pg1026"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">761.93/8–2945: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Harriman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-08-29T13:00:00+03:00">August 29, 1945—1
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received August 29—8:35 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3087. Sent to Dept as 3087, repeated to Chungking for the Ambassador as No.
                    118.</p>
                <p>You will note in my telegram No. 3086, August 29 noon,<anchor n="65"
                        xml:id="d758-f1"/> reporting certain matters that came up in my conversation
                    with Stalin on August 27, that he expects Chinese National Govt to send Chinese
                    troops to Manchuria in the near future to take over from the Russians in keeping
                    order and controlling Japanese saboteurs. This confirms Stalin’s agreement with
                    Soong that the Red Army should withdraw from Manchuria within three months.</p>
                <p>As it appears important that the Red Army be withdrawn from Manchuria within this
                    period, I assume immediate consideration is being given to this in the plans for
                    deployment of Chinese troops.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Harriman</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
